  "body_html": "<article class=\"flex min-w-0 flex-col gap-12 @md:gap-16 mt-10\"><div class=\"@container w-full max-w-container @md:shaded-container:px-0!\"><div class=\"relative w-full\" style=\"--hero-aspect-ratio:16/9;--hero-aspect-ratio-mobile:3/4\"><div class=\"@container w-full multi-columns:px-0 @md:shaded-container:px-0! toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px]\" data-section-header=\"true\"><div class=\"col-span-full col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-span-8 toc-visible:@md:col-start-1 @md:col-span-10 @md:col-start-2 @lg:col-span-8 @lg:col-start-3\"><div class=\"relative flex flex-col items-center text-center\"><div class=\"mb-8 flex flex-wrap gap-4 justify-center\" data-article-hero-copy-region=\"meta\"><p class=\"text-meta text-primary-100\">November 10, 2026</p><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-meta text-primary-60 hover:text-primary-100\" href=\"/news/company-announcements/\">Company</a></div><div class=\"\"><h1 class=\"text-h1 toc-collision-target max-w-250 text-primary-100 text-balance scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\" data-article-hero-copy-region=\"headline\">Helping caregivers use AI in everyday life</h1></div><div class=\"toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] mt-6 w-full\"><p class=\"col-span-full toc-collision-target text-primary-100 col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-1 @md:col-span-8 @md:col-start-3 justify-self-center text-balance\" data-article-hero-copy-region=\"subhead\">In collaboration with Caregiver Action Network, Alzheimer’s Association, and American Diabetes Association<sup>®</sup>, bringing free, hands-on ChatGPT workshops to five U.S. cities during National Family Caregivers Month.</p></div></div></div></div></div><div></div><div class=\"contents\"><div class=\"contents\"><div class=\"toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] @md:w-full article-actions-spacing pt-20 w-full\"><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 flex w-full flex-wrap items-start justify-between gap-x-6 gap-y-3 border-t border-t-primary-4 pt-3\" data-article-hero-actions=\"true\" data-article-hero-copy-region=\"support\"><div class=\"flex gap-4 ms-auto\"><div class=\"relative\"><div aria-expanded=\"false\" aria-haspopup=\"dialog\" class=\"flex items-center gap-1\" data-state=\"closed\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"text-cta\"><button class=\"transition duration-short ease-curve-a rounded-[2.5rem] text-nowrap min-h-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-[0.3em] text-cta focus:outline outline-offset-2 h-[2.5rem] text-primary-100 hover:text-primary-60 disabled:text-primary-44 focus:outline-none focus-visible:outline-primary-44 px-0 !rounded\" type=\"button\"><svg fill=\"none\" height=\"17\" viewbox=\"0 0 20 20\" width=\"24\" xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\"><path d=\"M4.52 7.62a.875.875 0 0 1 1.244 1.232L4.67 9.957l-.003.003c-1.384 1.385-1.421 3.658.147 5.227 1.568 1.568 3.842 1.531 5.227.147l.002-.002 1.107-1.095a.875.875 0 0 1 1.231 1.243l-1.106 1.096c-2.105 2.1-5.485 2.062-7.698-.152s-2.251-5.592-.15-7.697z\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"fill-opacity:1\"></path><path d=\"M11.881 6.881A.876.876 0 0 1 13.12 8.12l-5 5a.876.876 0 0 1-1.24-1.24z\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"fill-opacity:1\"></path><path d=\"M8.726 3.425c2.105-2.1 5.485-2.063 7.698.15s2.252 5.594.15 7.699L15.48 12.38a.875.875 0 0 1-1.244-1.231l1.095-1.107.003-.002c1.384-1.385 1.421-3.659-.147-5.227s-3.842-1.53-5.227-.147l-.003.003-1.106 1.095a.876.876 0 0 1-1.23-1.244z\" fill=\"currentColor\" style=\"fill-opacity:1\"></path></svg>Share</button></span></div></div></div></div></div></div></div></div><div class=\"contents\"><div class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] multi-columns:flex multi-columns:px-0 in-data-article-contained:flex in-data-article-contained:flex-col\"><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>Caregiving often means juggling schedules, keeping track of information, and finding support while balancing work and family life. During National Family Caregivers Month, we’re helping caregivers gain AI skills that can make some of those everyday tasks easier, giving them more time to focus on the people they care for.</span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>On November 10, OpenAI Academy, in collaboration with Caregiver Action Network, Alzheimer’s Association, and American Diabetes Association</span><sup><span><sup>®</sup></span></sup><span>, is hosting the AI Skills Jam for Caregivers &amp; Community Health: a free, in-person learning experience designed to help caregivers use ChatGPT confidently, safely, and practically. These nationwide events will bring together participants across five U.S. cities, including individual and family caregivers, caregiver support organizations, and people living with chronic or serious health conditions:</span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><ul class=\"mb-8 marker:text-inherit last:mb-0 in-[:where(ul,ol)]:mt-2 list-disc in-[:where(ul,ol)]:list-[circle] mx-3 ps-4\"><li class=\"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>Oakland, California</span></p></li><li class=\"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>Tampa, Florida</span></p></li><li class=\"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>Pittsburgh, Pennsylvania</span></p></li><li class=\"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>Atlanta, Georgia</span></p></li><li class=\"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>Detroit, Michigan</span></p></li></ul></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>An OpenAI analysis estimates that more than 40 million weekly ChatGPT messages about healthcare in the U.S. ask about healthcare for someone else</span><sup><span class=\"scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\" id=\"citation-top-1\"><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 text-xs text-primary-100 no-underline hover:text-primary-60\" href=\"#citation-bottom-1\">1</a></span></sup><span>. At the workshops, participants will explore how ChatGPT can help with resource navigation, peer support, and caregiver support, including how to: </span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><ul class=\"mb-8 marker:text-inherit last:mb-0 in-[:where(ul,ol)]:mt-2 list-disc in-[:where(ul,ol)]:list-[circle] mx-3 ps-4\"><li class=\"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>organize caregiver schedules and checklists</span></p></li><li class=\"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>turn trusted educational resources into plain-language materials</span></p></li><li class=\"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>find community resources</span></p></li><li class=\"mb-2 [&amp;&gt;p:only-of-type]:mb-0\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>prepare support group discussion guides</span></p></li></ul></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>Participants will also learn how to use AI responsibly, including protecting personal information and understanding the limits of these tools. </span><span>Participants will also learn when to consult healthcare professionals and how AI tools should complement, not replace, medical, legal, or financial advice.</span><b><span> </span></b><span>OpenAI facilitators and mentors will offer hands-on support throughout the workshops. No coding or technical background is required.</span></p></div><div class=\"group col-span-full not-first:mt-6 py-8\"><section class=\"max-w-container @container w-full toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px] multi-columns:flex multi-columns:px-0\"><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-1 @md:col-span-8 @md:col-start-3\"><div data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-carousel-view\"><div class=\"mb-3 flex justify-end\"><div class=\"flex shrink-0 items-center gap-3\" data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-controls\"><span class=\"text-meta text-primary-60\">1 of 4</span><div class=\"flex\"><button aria-label=\"Previous testimonial\" class=\"ease-curve-a disabled:text-gray-40 items-center justify-center outline-offset-2 duration-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-0 flex rounded-sm transition size-8 focus:outline-primary-44 text-btn-media-label\" disabled=\"\" type=\"button\"><svg height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><use height=\"16\" href=\"/icons/cms/a7687e3ce5db398c/arrow-left-lg.svg#size-16\" width=\"16\"></use></svg></button><button aria-label=\"Next testimonial\" class=\"ease-curve-a disabled:text-gray-40 items-center justify-center outline-offset-2 duration-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-0 flex rounded-sm transition size-8 text-primary-60 hover:bg-primary-4 hover:[&amp;&gt;svg]:opacity-60 focus:outline-primary-44 -ms-1 active:scale-95\" type=\"button\"><svg height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><use height=\"16\" href=\"/icons/cms/a7687e3ce5db398c/arrow-right-lg.svg#size-16\" width=\"16\"></use></svg></button></div></div></div><div class=\"border-primary-12 bg-secondary-100 dark:border-primary-4 dark:bg-tertiary-100 relative rounded-md border shadow-[0_18px_60px_rgb(0_0_0/0.08)] px-6 py-8\"><div class=\"no-scrollbar relative scroll-smooth snap-x snap-mandatory overflow-x-auto overflow-y-hidden overscroll-x-contain\" data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-scroll-region\"><div class=\"sticky inset-s-0 top-0 grid w-full\"><figure aria-live=\"polite\" class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 grid gap-5 self-start transition-opacity duration-250 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)] opacity-100\"><blockquote class=\"relative ms-[0.5em] text-h5 font-medium tracking-tight text-pretty text-primary-100\"><span class=\"absolute inset-s-[-0.5em] top-0\">“</span><span>AI is a tool for people to have more control over their lives and their families' lives. For caregivers, that can mean less time organizing schedules and searching for information, and more time focused on the people they care for. By working with trusted community organizations, we’re helping caregivers build the skills and confidence to use these tools safely and practically.</span>”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"ms-[0.5em] text-meta text-primary-60\"><span>— Chris Lehane, OpenAI’s Chief Global Affairs Officer</span></figcaption></figure><figure aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 grid gap-5 self-start transition-opacity duration-250 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)] pointer-events-none invisible opacity-0\" inert=\"\"><blockquote class=\"relative ms-[0.5em] text-h5 font-medium tracking-tight text-pretty text-primary-100\"><span class=\"absolute inset-s-[-0.5em] top-0\">“</span><span>The future of caregiving isn’t about replacing human connection with technology. It’s about using innovation to make care more manageable, accessible and connected. AI has real potential to help caregivers navigate information, coordinate responsibilities and reclaim valuable time, but only if we build their confidence and keep their needs at the center. This National Family Caregivers Month, we’re proud to join OpenAI Academy, the Alzheimer’s Association and the American Diabetes Association in helping caregivers explore what’s possible and have a voice in shaping what comes next.</span>”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"ms-[0.5em] text-meta text-primary-60\"><b><span>— Marvell Adams Jr., CEO, Caregiver Action Network</span></b></figcaption></figure><figure aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 grid gap-5 self-start transition-opacity duration-250 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)] pointer-events-none invisible opacity-0\" inert=\"\"><blockquote class=\"relative ms-[0.5em] text-h5 font-medium tracking-tight text-pretty text-primary-100\"><span class=\"absolute inset-s-[-0.5em] top-0\">“</span><span>Caregivers are constantly balancing information, schedules, and difficult decisions while supporting someone they love. Responsible AI tools have the potential to make everyday caregiving tasks more manageable and help people find trusted information more efficiently. We’re pleased to partner on this effort to help caregivers build confidence using these tools safely and effectively.</span>”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"ms-[0.5em] text-meta text-primary-60\"><b><span>— Katie Evans, Chief Programs &amp; Mission Engagement Officer at Alzheimer’s Association</span></b></figcaption></figure><figure aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"col-start-1 row-start-1 grid gap-5 self-start transition-opacity duration-250 ease-[cubic-bezier(0.23,1,0.32,1)] pointer-events-none invisible opacity-0\" inert=\"\"><blockquote class=\"relative ms-[0.5em] text-h5 font-medium tracking-tight text-pretty text-primary-100\"><span class=\"absolute inset-s-[-0.5em] top-0\">“</span><span>Caregivers play a critical role in caring for people with diabetes. They have a lot on their plate, so using AI can help ease some of the work they do. The American Diabetes Association is working with AI platforms to ensure they are receiving information based on our latest guidelines. We are proud to be a part of the AI Skills Jam to help caregivers confidently navigate AI.</span>”</blockquote><figcaption class=\"ms-[0.5em] text-meta text-primary-60\"><b><span>— Charles “Chuck” Henderson, Chief Executive Officer of the American Diabetes Association<sup>®</sup></span></b></figcaption></figure></div><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"flex h-0 w-full\"><div class=\"h-px w-full shrink-0 snap-center snap-always\"></div><div class=\"h-px w-full shrink-0 snap-center snap-always\"></div><div class=\"h-px w-full shrink-0 snap-center snap-always\"></div><div class=\"h-px w-full shrink-0 snap-center snap-always\"></div></div></div><span aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"border-primary-12 bg-secondary-100 dark:border-primary-4 dark:bg-tertiary-100 -translate-inline-1/2 pointer-events-none absolute bottom-[-0.4rem] z-1 hidden size-3 rotate-45 rounded-xs border-e border-b md:block\" data-testid=\"testimonial-carousel-tail\" style=\"inset-inline-start:12.5%\"></span></div><div class=\"relative mt-3 overflow-hidden\"><div aria-hidden=\"true\" class=\"pointer-events-none absolute inset-0 z-1 hidden md:block\"><ul class=\"flex\" style=\"width:100%;mask-image:linear-gradient(#000 0 0);mask-position:0% 0;mask-repeat:no-repeat;mask-size:25% 100%;-webkit-mask-image:linear-gradient(#000 0 0);-webkit-mask-position:0% 0;-webkit-mask-repeat:no-repeat;-webkit-mask-size:25% 100%\"><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 25%\"><div class=\"flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full p-2 text-center text-caption text-balance text-primary-100\">Chris Lehane</div></li><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 25%\"><div class=\"flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full p-2 text-center text-caption text-balance text-primary-100\">Marvell Adams Jr.</div></li><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 25%\"><div class=\"flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full p-2 text-center text-caption text-balance text-primary-100\">Katie Evans</div></li><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 25%\"><div class=\"flex min-h-11 w-full items-center justify-center rounded-full p-2 text-center text-caption text-balance text-primary-100\">Charles “Chuck” Henderson</div></li></ul></div><ul aria-label=\"Testimonials\" class=\"relative flex\" style=\"width:100%\"><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 25%\"><button aria-current=\"true\" aria-label=\"Show testimonial from Chris Lehane\" class=\"relative flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center bg-transparent p-2 text-center text-caption text-primary-60 transition-[background-color,color,opacity,transform] duration-short ease-curve-a focus-visible:z-1 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-44 active:scale-98 w-full rounded-full hover:bg-primary-4 text-primary-100 md:text-primary-60\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"text-balance\">Chris Lehane</span></button></li><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 25%\"><button aria-current=\"false\" aria-label=\"Show testimonial from Marvell Adams Jr.\" class=\"relative flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center bg-transparent p-2 text-center text-caption text-primary-60 transition-[background-color,color,opacity,transform] duration-short ease-curve-a focus-visible:z-1 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-44 active:scale-98 w-full rounded-full hover:bg-primary-4\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"text-balance\">Marvell Adams Jr.</span></button></li><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 25%\"><button aria-current=\"false\" aria-label=\"Show testimonial from Katie Evans\" class=\"relative flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center bg-transparent p-2 text-center text-caption text-primary-60 transition-[background-color,color,opacity,transform] duration-short ease-curve-a focus-visible:z-1 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-44 active:scale-98 w-full rounded-full hover:bg-primary-4\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"text-balance\">Katie Evans</span></button></li><li class=\"min-w-0 px-1\" style=\"flex:0 0 25%\"><button aria-current=\"false\" aria-label=\"Show testimonial from Charles “Chuck” Henderson\" class=\"relative flex min-h-11 items-center justify-center bg-transparent p-2 text-center text-caption text-primary-60 transition-[background-color,color,opacity,transform] duration-short ease-curve-a focus-visible:z-1 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary-44 active:scale-98 w-full rounded-full hover:bg-primary-4\" type=\"button\"><span class=\"text-balance\">Charles “Chuck” Henderson</span></button></li></ul></div></div></div></section></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>The Jam brings this learning into local communities, where caregivers can practice alongside peers and share the everyday challenges they hope these tools can help address. Our partners bring deep expertise and experience supporting people living with serious illness and their families. Their perspectives, together with those of caregivers themselves, will help connect the day’s learning to the needs of each community.</span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>The AI Skills Jam is part of OpenAI Academy’s broader work to make AI practical and accessible to everyone. It builds on previous events we’ve hosted with nonprofits, small businesses, K–12 educators, and older adults.</span></p></div><div class=\"col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4 max-w-none min-w-0 in-[:where(li)]:contents not-first:mt-6\"><p class=\"mb-(--prose-body-margin-bottom,--spacing(6)) last:mb-0\"><span>We are grateful to Caregiver Action Network, Alzheimer’s Association, American Diabetes Association</span><sup><span><sup>®</sup></span></sup><span>, and the caregivers and community health organizations joining us across the country. Their questions, ideas, and experiences will help shape future learning resources and ensure these tools are useful in the daily work of supporting others.</span></p></div></div></div><section class=\"max-w-container @container w-full scroll-mt-anchor-offset\" data-testid=\"citations\" id=\"citations\"><div class=\"rounded-md bg-primary-4 py-8 md:py-16 toc-visible:md:grid-cols-10 grid grid-cols-12 gap-x-(--grid-gap) [--grid-gap:8px] md:[--grid-gap:16px] lg:[--grid-gap:24px]\"><div class=\"flex flex-col gap-8 px-5 @md:px-0 col-span-full toc-visible:@md:col-start-2 @md:col-span-6 @md:col-start-4\"><section class=\"w-full\"><ul class=\"flex flex-wrap gap-3\"><li><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 block rounded-xl bg-primary-4 px-3 py-2! text-nav hover:bg-primary-12\" href=\"/news/?tags=2026\">2026</a></li><li><a class=\"transition ease-curve-a duration-250 block rounded-xl bg-primary-4 px-3 py-2! text-nav hover:bg-primary-12\" href=\"/news/?tags=chatgpt\">ChatGPT</a></li></ul></section><div data-testid=\"author-list\"><h2 class=\"mb-3 text-p2 text-primary-60\">Author</h2><div class=\"text-p2\">OpenAI</div></div><div data-testid=\"author-list\"><h2 class=\"mb-3 text-p2 text-primary-60\">Footnotes</h2><div class=\"prose prose-sm max-w-none\"><ol class=\"mb-0! grid grid-cols-1 gap-x-6 gap-y-3 px-0!\"><li class=\"relative mt-0! mb-[.75rem]! inline-grid grid-cols-[auto_1fr] gap-x-2 before:hidden scroll-mt-[calc(var(--page-top-space,var(--header-h))+var(--toc-button-h)+var(--anchor-scroll-clearance))]\" id=\"citation-bottom-1\"><span class=\"my-0! w-4 text-p2 text-primary-60\">1</span><div class=\"mb-0 [&amp;_p]:mb-0!\"><p class=\"wrap-break-word [word-break:break-word]\"><span>This is from a privacy-preserving ChatGPT usage estimate for October 9–29, 2026</span><span class=\"inline-block align-middle\"><a aria-label=\"Scroll to citation 1 reference\" class=\"ease-curve-a disabled:text-gray-40 items-center justify-center outline-offset-2 duration-200 focus-visible:outline focus-visible:outline-offset-0 flex rounded-full transition size-4 focus:outline-primary-44 text-primary-60 hover:bg-none hover:[&amp;&gt;svg]:opacity-60 ms-1 scale-inline-100\" href=\"#citation-top-1\"><svg height=\"16\" viewbox=\"0 0 16 16\" width=\"16\"><use height=\"16\" href=\"/icons/cms/a7687e3ce5db398c/arrow-curvedpath-left-md.svg#size-16\" width=\"16\"></use></svg></a></span></p></div></li></ol></div></div></div></div></section><div class=\"@container w-full\"><div class=\"max-w-container mb-8 flex items-baseline justify-between\"><div><h2 class=\"text-h4 text-primary-100\">Keep reading</h2></div><a class=\"transition duration-short ease-curve-a rounded-[2.5rem] text-nowrap min-h-8 flex items-center justify-center gap-[0.3e